# Categories Panel Architecture

## Component hierarchy

```
CategoriesPanel
├── SortableCategoryCard (drag-and-drop reorder)
│   ├── SortableFilterItem (drag-and-drop reorder, expand/collapse, inline rename)
│   │   ├── RuleGroupItem (read-only display)
│   │   └── EditFilterRuleGroupsForm (edit mode)
│   └── CreateFilterForm (inline creation)
└── CreateCategoryForm
```

## State management

- `useCategoriesPanelState` — shared panel state: queries, drag handlers, delete filter
- `useFilterForm` — form state for both creating and editing filters/rule groups
  - `initNewFilter(rule)` — sets up a blank filter with one rule group
  - `initExistingFilter(filter)` — populates form from an existing `Filter` object
  - Temporary IDs use `temp-` prefix (e.g. `temp-<uuid>`); strip these before sending to the API so the backend treats them as new entities

## API integration

- Create filter: `POST /filters` via `useCreateFilterMutation`
- Rename filter: `PATCH /filters/{id}` with `name` via `useRenameFilterMutation`
- Edit rule groups: `PUT /filters/{id}/rule-groups` via `usePutFilterRuleGroupsMutation`
- Reorder: `PATCH /categories/{id}` or `PATCH /filters/{id}` with `position`
- Delete: `DELETE /filters/{id}` via `useDeleteFilterMutation`
- All mutations invalidate the `CATEGORIES_QUERY_KEY` to refresh the panel

## Data model (Filter → RuleGroup → Rule)

- **Filter**: `id`, `name`, `position`, `categoryId`, `ruleGroups[]`
- **RuleGroup**: `id`, `operator` (currently only `AND`), `rules[]`
- **Rule**: `id`, `type` (DESCRIPTION | AMOUNT | PRODUCT), `operator` (EQUAL | NOT_EQUAL | GREATER_THAN | LESS_THAN | GREATER_THAN_EQUAL | LESS_THAN_EQUAL), `value`
